    cover that path). The menu now leads with 'Add to favorites'
    that flips to 'Remove from favorites' once the contact is
    starred, followed by Edit / Delete.
  * Contacts list is split into two Gtk.Expander sections
    sharing one search field: 'Favorites' (hidden when no
    contact is starred) above 'Contacts'. Both expanded by
    default; click the section header to collapse / expand.

